```text
ROCm 7.2 Linux Ryzen matrix:

* Supported architecture: ``gfx1151``.
* Listed hardware includes AMD Ryzen AI Max+ 395, Ryzen AI Max 390, and Ryzen AI Max 385.
* Ubuntu 24.04.3 is listed, with preliminary support via the 24.04.2 installer.
* PyTorch 2.9 is listed with official production support; FP16 is the officially validated AI data type.

This is a platform/framework matrix. It does not state that every ROCm component,
RCCL multi-node operation, or Ethernet-over-USB4 topology is validated.
```
